{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:32:58.341957+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_01a08475dfffa85f71ca53cafbce82c3fb48e9f8dad9a8483b256e02fc278716","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem app1 of arXiv:2505.24821, 'Asymptotics for the harmonic descent chain and applications to critical beta-splitting tre'] Let $d_n = \zeta_3(Z_n, \tau_n N_1)$. Then 
    \begin{equation}
