{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:07:48.566412+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0498cc7801af950ea8bec787b5034dd3fddcb9b7a30c3f1767c43d6cc22dc62e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 28 of arXiv:2609.01460, 'On cost-induced Santal\'o-type inequalities \\ in Polish measure spaces'] Let $n,m \in \N$. Then, for any $Q \in \conbodo[m]$, and any compact set $K\subset \R^n$ with positive volume such that $o\in \operatorname{int}\operatorname{conv}(K)$,
