{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:29:08.521813+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_04b6fac0cbce284117356530f53bf8a60156302d6aab6fc9d6ba9f8c2e725945","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:lcft-H-strip of arXiv:2411.19810, 'Radial conformal welding in Liouville quantum gravity'] For $\beta_1, \beta_2, \beta_3\in\mathbb{R}$ and $s_3\in\partial\mathcal{S}$, we have 
