{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-09-07T12:18:10.806945+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_050c632c179dc3cd02b8e2da6984071b8f39eb86290aec0204938b68d2ad3dae","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 7 of arXiv:2512.19517, 'Spiking and Resetting'] The process $({\bar X}^\varepsilon_t)_{t \ge 0}$ with state space $\{0,1\}$ and c\`adl\`ag  trajectories defined by 
