{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:38:13.640767+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_05b6c19d0a35cf73f7dddc1271f7102247622d649c178b3d33c52e9b6944026a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 21 of arXiv:2609.00690, 'Boundary behavior and optimal pointwise H\"older exponent of the total local time of $(1+\'] Fix $t\geq0$. Then
