{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:30:24.615969+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_06c6afe29a1de3df7e51a6a6c92f2e02263cbd0165038172f801870a4e8e14e5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 12 of arXiv:2506.09592, 'Extremal process of the local time of simple\\random walk on a regular tree'] For $n\ge1$,~$t>0$ and~$\lambda>0$, denote
