{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:21:52.414426+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_06fd02b85b9ea8231e873ec5cb01ef76e1b52069e97cfecd5c24e6407c25c38f","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 80 of arXiv:2601.16377, '2601.16377'] Let $\mathcal A^{\textnormal{s}}_\eps\subset \W_\N$ denote the set of configurations such that
