{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:41:28.167052+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_07fd7b9945519d7679094c144701b4dd89373130308820c448a37b360941a85f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:count_TWG of arXiv:2510.26724, 'Sharp Fuss-Catalan thresholds in graph bootstrap percolation'] For all integers $k\geqslant0$, we have that 
