 we have that { $\mathcal{H}_{-q_0} (z) \le H^{N_i}_t (z) \le \mathcal{H}_{q_0} (z)$} for all $z \in \mathfrak{X}$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

