{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:30:24.617073+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0a17bc4e2a0db5329bee525418ab2edc3202cf30af273ef2b7b7776337f8578b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 21 of arXiv:2506.09592, 'Extremal process of the local time of simple\\random walk on a regular tree'] We have
