{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:52:05.661424+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0a686e3ff06a08653a66b5dcbc78a5d338dff36649e3a4b00a45d562179ef33f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop eq:switching of arXiv:2602.06011, 'Excursion decomposition of the XOR-Ising model'] For any set of vertices $A\subset D_\delta\backslash \partial D_{\delta}$,
