{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:18.061043+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0d6dc37d613ef8cbf379be84d224b4b5d31a135a8028903e522cfe1da5871ddf","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 of arXiv:2606.17381, 'Large deviation principle for friendship-biases\\ in Galton--Watson trees'] {\bf[Spectral representation of $\Lambda$]}

