{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:47.663192+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_118357fcf75a2669709eabcbcd4084f0d69ccb78910d02d43c73c636e9cb85f6","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 20 of arXiv:2605.09372, 'Sharp weighted norm estimates for martingale square functions'] Let $1<p<\infty$. Given a  scalar
