{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:09:49.849618+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_11ae1256fbb77c443d1e4b4fa01f1cda6515a8ab01c0f3d92b8975e455561d7c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 63 of arXiv:2609.03070, 'Variants of order semicontinuity in Banach lattices'] The following conditions are equivalent:
