{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:19:06.753674+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_131582dc732abd054804150b3846a626f5db1a7172f6b1dd794f3761469f76c4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:arclength-forcing-nonmass-paper of arXiv:2606.08683, 'Exact Fourier dimensions of dyadic Mandelbrot cascades under minimal integrability'] If \(2^n\le\lvert\xi\rvert\le2^{n+1}\) and \(d\in\mathfrak D_{\xi,n}^{\mathrm{osc}}\), then
