{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:09.068114+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1363cf2e27b868493112c7b43a5a028c85abcee20293e9bab88fb60085a18c9f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 (Variational formula for left edge) of arXiv:2606.27774, 'Variational Formulas for the Spectrum of\\ Block Wishart Matrices'] Fix $k \ge 1$ integer, $\alpha \in (0,\infty)$, and $\nu\in\cuP_0(\sa{k}{\C})$.
