        \pi_{\mathbb T^d}\Big( |\sum_{v} \sigma_v|\le 2 \Big) \le C e^{ - cn^{d-1}}\,.
    \end{align*} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:51:11.519744+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_17820a9e1c697d0924c38a3af3b7ba19e6830b54f851a9d045af8374355cbf34","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 13 (Rare positive jumps) of arXiv:2609.02590, 'Directional Optimal Sub-Gamma Scales for Infinitely Divisible Laws'] As $p\downarrow0$,
\begin{equation}
 t_p=L+3\log L-\log2+o(1),

