\end{align}
\end{itemize}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:21:52.488361+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_17f21007ba2994569980700649d94ae7724a7b8367abb8c63362942def4b27bb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 205 of arXiv:2601.16377, '2601.16377'] Choose a polynomial $p(z)$ of degree at most $H-1$ and suppose that $f \in \mathscr{H}^{[2],0}$ satisfies
