{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:46:36.095617+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_180ede728f4f3b6e2eed9e4e92ae576e9fd570c07d73d172738a204d07f56e88","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor cor14 of arXiv:2609.02795, 'Global smooth behavior in Kuznetsov and Westervelt type\\ viscous wave equations:\\ A unif'] Let $p\ge 2$. Then there exist $\Gamma_4=\Gamma_4(p,a,h)>0$ and $\Gamma_5=\Gamma_5(p,a,h)>0$ such that if ((init of the paper)) 
