{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:25.272327+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_19b4a94a46defa8a29bf6b32545e579cad1ee3b0aa853b6f96ab2c0d7977d386","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 of arXiv:2606.21111, 'On Elephant Random Walk with Delayed Amnesia'] For $0\le p<(4a-1)/4a$, we have
