{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:51:26.590801+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1c6c1e8c581ea8851a599afef3c85d1c811b646d7770806e43833c3645c30ddb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:codiff-asymp of arXiv:2606.02003, 'Higher-Order Multifractional Stable Motion:\\ Definition and Fundamental Properties'] Under Assumptions~(ass:params of the paper) and~(ass:limits of the paper), for fixed
$s \in \mathbb{R}$ and as $t \to +\infty$:
\begin{equation}

