{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:36:04.990116+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1cdf027beb37ef1aa1111027d558c4ad7fdc1e1c8ae001cbe417f86ff1a9266d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 10 of arXiv:2604.00882, 'On some extensions of generalized counting processes'] The probabilities ${\tilde p}_n^\nu(t)$
satisfy the following  equation
\begin{equation}
