\end{equation}
with the standard initial condition and fractional derivatives in C-D sense.

	The solution ${\tilde p}_n^\nu(t)$, for $n = 0, 1, \dots$ and $t \ge 0$, of \eqref{fM2eq} is given as follows:
	\begin{description}
