{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:57:49.862660+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1ce63a7b40ccfab224a4786b4b7a51f64841d7f551d55cbf4bc9176d1bcc2089","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem max-growth of arXiv:2410.24170, 'Persistent hubs in CMJ branching processes with independent increments and preferential at'] For any $\varepsilon > 0$, there exists $r > 0$ such that
