{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:21:10.899123+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1dd2525d2bb063a25d97f8dbc7d2f911d0b10b1d65f9ce8f5236c84adb820ad1","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 19 of arXiv:2601.16377, '2601.16377'] Given an $H$-tuple $\boldsymbol{\nu}=(\nu_h)_{h = 1}^H$ of nonnegative measures, with $\nu_h$ having support in $[\hat a'_h,\hat b'_h]$ and a density $\nu_h(x)$ with respect to the Lebesgue measure, we define
 \begin{equation}

