{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:36:04.990695+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1ea33c84428bd863a81e15f420a460c9f6cf406d958a6cff9c0326c8876f1e30","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 17 of arXiv:2604.00882, 'On some extensions of generalized counting processes'] The probabilities ${p}^{\alpha,\rho}_n(t)=\Prob\{N(\mathcal{L}^{\alpha,\rho}(t))=n\}$ satisfy the following  equation
	\begin{equation}
