{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:57:30.986690+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_21e6504b630a339cde7c39657f0ca86a1ae98dcce3a698aea434f218cd49c191","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 23 (Exact mixed-degree formula) of arXiv:2608.12492, 'Weak Limits of Wiener Chaos: Primitive--Fock Classification and Hilbert--Stein Extraction'] For $p,q\ge1$, $f\in H^{\odot p}$, and $g\in H^{\odot q}$,
