{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:00:22.782007+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_21e9a07f6c3e84aa5dbea708af88f816d4e3d0a1cbfa9a98f34871d2fa95eb8b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lm Perm Expansion of arXiv:2411.01633, 'On the Limit of the Tridiagonal Model \\for $\beta$-Dyson Brownian Motion'] For deterministic matrices $A_1,\dots ,A_j$, we have
