{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:11:09.330333+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_229a7f5e55c463454be7c639fe5405c3a75151093ecb2af31f62b717977dd7f5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition of arXiv:2411.06827, 'The Exponential Lie Series and a Chen--Strichartz Formula for L{\'e}vy Processes'] The flowmap $\varphi$ has the representation
