{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:34.579948+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_234856fd6537a19c9226484b50e198b1554ac43669311d3d5e29d088cc8931cc","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 26 of arXiv:2606.14876, 'High-Order Talagrand and Eldan--Gross Inequalities via Besov-Type Variance Functionals'] For all $k\in \Nbb_{\leq n}$, $f:\cube^n\to \Rbb$, $q\in [1,2)$ and $t\geq 0$,
