{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:53.162756+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2406db9559a1768a1a6028fcac4a3524fa107c5c6ae71a0320dd72bc3841fff7","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 14 of arXiv:2606.29512, '2606.29512'] Let $u$ be an $\R^d$-valued admissible function and let
