{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:49:02.087817+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_24113782a23deb75454bcc8096c4e1953cda4bd54649e06771931493e8db3474","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 of arXiv:2604.25769, 'The conformal dimension of the Brownian tree is one'] Condition~\eqref{eq:admissibility} is satisfied: Let $n \in \BN$ and $y, x_0, x_1, \ldots, x_N \in \SCT$ such that
