{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:41:19.334112+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_24157fa5d003596bac4300fad9bddbe542ab3a30cd2bf0d7853f77a97a036df9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemme approx explo unif of arXiv:2609.04138, 'The conformally invariant metric on $\CLE_4$ I:\\ subsequential limits of the non-simple C'] With the above choice of $X^n_k$'s we have the convergence in probability 
