{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:33.753458+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_241aaca1c755d07526abab0d437babddd8cfad925bcdeea44aea55c9a52ddbd9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 20 ({\cite{HHO18}*{Theorem 2.31}}) of arXiv:2609.03836, 'Koszul Orlik--Solomon Algebras from Non-supersolvable Arrangements'] \label[Thm]{thm:Koszul_retracts}
