{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:27:36.724079+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_24e1c346f485eeb609166e5a2012d06957c4c332e99616633cc65da9ae88d87a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 20 of arXiv:2511.13559, 'Asymptotic analysis of rare events in high dimensions'] The derivative bounds~\eqref{forq},~\eqref{forw} of Proposition~\ref{prop:main} imply 
\begin{align}
