(ii) if $x<X_t^{s, r}$, then $\check{X}_u^{t, x} \leq X_u^{s, r}$ for all $u \in [s,t]$, while if $x>X_t^{s, r}$, then $\check{X}_u^{t, x} \geq X_u^{s, r}$ for all $u \in [s,t]$.","status":"unverified"}

