{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:37.353125+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2813a86be02e4e1c50fa6becec3b6881f9babcc20181297f8b742bba8fa45809","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 21 of arXiv:2606.17472, '2606.17472'] The stochastic process
