{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:50:48.852496+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2c0d3e49970b70e8975ee805e0ea80844a8421180da02261e3cdaf5fe1b0a8e6","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem t:harris of arXiv:2607.10708, 'A class of Markov processes with resetting and applications to cybersecurity'] Suppose $\alpha >0$ and let  define
