{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:43:45.381394+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2c3e20a7e6050192fcb95f04c321f190e18b5161b1f36ad62476816747f6212c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 31 of arXiv:2609.04033, 'From configuration spaces to graph complexes via $\mathbf{FA}$-modules'] For all $n$ and $r\geq 3$, there is an $S_n$-equivariant quasi-isomorphism




