{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:12:19.519370+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2e8666a4c996220441bb0bec585b7017ada5dde13744356f34bd3bce97197fbb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 2 (Feige's conjectures) of arXiv:2608.18392, 'On Samuels' Conjecture'] Let $X_1,\ldots,X_n$ be independent nonnegative random variables satisfying
