{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:53:10.212236+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2e8ebc5bbf95af62d27b00304d0fa5038a8511b84c33b9259942d183a2977e61","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem head-randomization of arXiv:2608.29018, 'Sharp Restricted Isometry Thresholds for\\ Global Minima of Rank-Restricted Matrix LASSO'] One has \begin{subequations}
