{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:41:11.633038+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2ef23ef38da0665d9276d3a0d7d65e405e5972e8f4c12aafabd9ef793b4ea5c6","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:capacitydecomp of arXiv:2411.13505, 'Capacity of loop-erased random walk'] Let $A=\{x_1,\ldots,x_n\}\subset\mathbb{Z}^d$. Then
