{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:36:31.222118+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_325d3de0e53abef3fb63efe7ccc375e3738880a5738240937ad009d41435ed78","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 2 (Control of the geometric velocity) of arXiv:2609.00501, 'Uniqueness of Finite-Time Varifold Limits for the M\"obius-Invariant Willmore Flow'] Assume \eqref{eq:un}.  Then, for every $0<t<T$,
