{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:29:14.930814+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_35f2f24c950667320f116488191469778452126127c49fccc59602a05f267fe1","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop.GreenEstimate of arXiv:2606.13442, 'Scaling limit of additive functionals for reversible non-gradient exclusion process: criti'] The following estimates hold for the Green function $\overline{g}_\lambda$.
		\begin{enumerate}
			\item 
