{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:57:20.666361+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_386fc20c4851309b03a00bf6176b55aaf8aa0397a591ff8d7ea71fe7aee5c936","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:Bounds_on_q of arXiv:2411.10113, 'Long-range one-dimensional\\ internal diffusion-limited aggregation'] Suppose that~(equation ass:irreducible of the paper) holds, and
