{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:21:52.421155+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3989dde5b0c47cc1d007438edf0bf87b766557df2252fdc14d9fd66e347e83ca","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 132 of arXiv:2601.16377, '2601.16377'] Assume in the setting of Theorem~\ref{Theorem_correlators_expansion} that we have $\theta_{g,g} = 1$ for every $g \in [H]$. Let $h \in [H]$ and set
