\] (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:32:19.897521+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_399366bb8fbf1cd53005d12ab3135abe619fbff070286e1ad798365f42c4450b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 8 of arXiv:2608.02103, '$p$-Adic Diffusion and Random Walks on $[0,1]$'] The assignment     \begin{equation}
