{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:35:59.932368+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3a1148d20f0f973aa0235d9deabdb637e2ea39596eebf8349d5685bed1151945","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 95 of arXiv:2608.26084, 'Localic Esakia Duality\\via Conic Frames'] For any finite family~$a_i,b_i\in A$, with~$i\in I$:
	\[
