{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:27:25.783634+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3a15e6a49ef82c6d1faf76eaed849f673f3ebaf4712d432215f38dcc70e42b16","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:Dtilde of arXiv:2605.08052, 'Rapid phase ordering of Ising dynamics on $\mathbb Z^2$'] For $B \in \mathscr{B}_0$, let $$\widetilde{D}_0(B) = \mathbf 1\Big\{\bigcup_{v\in B} Q(v) = -1\Big\}\,.$$ Now suppose we have defined $(\widetilde{D}_{k-1}(B'))_{B'\in \mathscr{B}_{k-1}}$; for each $B\in \mathscr{B}_k$, we will describe how to assign $\widetilde{D}_k(B)$.  Define 
    \begin{align}
        \mathsf{Dis}_{k-1}(B) & = \{B' \in \mathscr{B}_{k-1}: B' \subset E_{+2}(B)\,,\,\widetilde D_{k-1}(B') = 1\} \,, \\ 
        \mathsf{Bad_{k-1}}(B)& = \{B' \in \mathscr{B}_{k-1}: B' \subset E_{+3}(B)\,,\, \mathsf{StatEquiv}_{k-1}(B')^c \text{ or } \mathsf{InfProp}_{k-1}(B')^c \text{ hold}\}\,. 
    \end{align}
    ($\mathsf{Dis}_{k-1}$ is roughly the set of blocks one scale down that were $1$ in the dominating set, and $\mathsf{Bad}_{k-1}$ are those one scale down that had very atypical events happen for them.) 
    We then set 
    \begin{align*}
        \widetilde{D}_k(B) = 1 - \mathbf 1\{|\mathsf{Dis}_{k-1}(B)| \le s_k\,,\, \mathsf{Bad}_{k-1}(B) =\emptyset\,,\, \mathsf{InfProp}_k(B), \mathsf{LocCoup}_k(B)\}\,.
    \end{align*}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:52:05.692774+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3a1696a8dbcfd97fbf0e1205ff52b19f8d2c4d800782eba65e7fbd1dd609f0e1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop p:300.2 of arXiv:2602.21277, 'A Limit in Law for the Cover Time and Last Visited Vertex of Wired Planar Domains'] Fix $u \geq 0$. For all $k \geq 0$, there exists a bounded function $\varphi^{k}_u :
\mathbb{R}^{{\rm Q}(k)} \to \mathbb{R}_+$ such that, for any measurable positive function $f: {\rm D} \to \mathbb{R}_+$ with compact support,

\begin{equation}

\begin{split}
\lim_{n \to \infty}
\bigg|\mathbb{E} \bigg( \xi_n \exp \bigg\{ -\int f(x) & \big({\bf \Xi}_{n,u}^k \cap {\bf \Gamma}_{n,u}\big)
({\rm d} x)\bigg\} \bigg) \\
& - \mathbb{E} \bigg( \xi_n \exp \bigg\{-\frac{1}{\sqrt{n}} \int \varphi^k_u(\omega) \big(1-{\rm e}^{-f(x)}\big){\bf \Lambda}_{n,u}^{k}({\rm d} x \times {\rm d} \omega)
