{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:58.700982+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3ac1683e149cff1aabe29e118fc80651f6ef74da60ad5a6ec32521b66ebf879e","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:dsm of arXiv:2510.22778, 'Free denoising diffusion models'] Let $\{g_{\theta}\}_{\theta\in\Theta}$ be a family of maps sending a self-adjoint
operator to a self-adjoint operator, and let $w:[0,T]\to(0,\infty)$ be a weight.
Define
\begin{equation}
