{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:55:57.002699+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3dd725d67c3a78b38023baa7e37a61fcf11d68e6a91d22dacc84a2801db03e6d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 of arXiv:2609.02790, 'Full-Model Optimality for Tunable Linear Generative Priors in Compressed Sensing'] Let $M_k = \begin{bmatrix}
