{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:18.054740+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3dff86af4f5f42ae5059f48f9b293979efc8a7acef9b6c85e8e7c6577fbace65","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 3 (Convexity of $\psi_\circ$) of arXiv:2606.16636, 'Free energy of non-convex multi-species spin glasses with centered Ising spins'] For every $q_0,q_1 \in \mcl Q_1$ and \(\lambda\in[0,1]\), we have
