{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:01:22.588346+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3e94f12b504356d96e25e4f21eaaccdcbb9c91c906517bc30274fcb1e43770f4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem Thm-(u P)-local of arXiv:2605.16963, 'Stochastic Euler Equations with Pseudo-differential Noise: Continuous and Discontinuous Pe'] Let $d \geq 2$, $p\ge 1$ and $\Upgamma\ge0$.  
