{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:32:19.921507+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3f1a69be3a05b20798a4efbb5f6ad7ee2fd325e789d94681cb7d5cf47ddc9e9b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 of arXiv:2608.02927, 'Thinning Operation via the Poisson-F\"ollmer Process'] [Klartag, Lehec \cite{KL}, Lemma 4.3]

