{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:09.039730+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3f64f784ede333483a4952588c79a6fbb5d3b7f55253757e793e8d8a6a995e2e","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 1 of arXiv:2606.26619, 'Ergodicity of stochastic reaction-diffusion equations on unbounded domains driven by space'] We say that an adapted,
