{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:34:20.707557+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_40d4024291195d9a116534d60c32c4eff24dd3a0c81802f9552aa1229f275f0b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 10 (Half-bridge correction) of arXiv:2609.02196, 'Schr\"odinger Bridges on Lie Group Manifolds for Probabilistic Intrinsic Generation'] The updates
