{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:42:08.418069+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_412fb0a7089945e6eb39348207a840980d2fc0e79dab9d8d0c8a8f278f7f9db7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:Tlm-k of arXiv:2511.15893, 'On a Class of Dynamical Poisson-Voronoi Tessellations'] For $i\neq j, q\in \{1,2\}$, under the Palm probability measure of mixed handovers of type $\bbinom{q}{i,j}$, the Laplace transform of $T$ is

