{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:30:50.735022+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_41435c5cd87251b2f796cd31f51bfd6223eafab88115184346b038e9e63198d5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop_reduced_adj_LSI of arXiv:2503.24372, 'A criterion on the free energy for log-Sobolev inequalities in mean-field particle systems'] The measure $\mu^{B,\varphi}_T$ satisfies a log-Sobolev inequality with constant $\gamma^B_{\rm LS}(T)$ independent of $\varphi$ and bounded as follows, 
