{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:30.012949+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_421fa24c9f49f4eeec5084a6ff156ee367d012bcd6863b03c2ef2f6b8863e398","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 19 of arXiv:2605.04359, 'Well-posedness of reflected BSDEs with default time and irregular barrier: An application '] Let $\L$ be a process satisfying condition \textbf{(H3')} with $\L \in \mathcal{S}^2_{2 \beta}$. Assume moreover that $\L$ is r.u.s.c along stopping times.\\
