{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:51:11.454591+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4255d1277a57f94e52356be9bee42dc3dfb2b4dc9cc1d41aa93be1ce0aa14e28","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 2 (Proposition 2.2 in \cite{Guan-Ma2003}) of arXiv:2609.02516, 'Power convexity of the torsion function on horo-convex domains in hyperbolic space'] Suppose that $W=(w_{\alpha\beta})$ is diagonal. For $k=1,2,\cdots,n$, we have
