{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:45:07.258347+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_42cb52604989cad4972f4d1b635824a9bd5c1fdd16167f484aa3658bbe160dcd","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 14 of arXiv:2604.19308, '\textbf{On McKean--Vlasov SDEs with polynomial drifts for SIS epidemic models}'] Assume that~\eqref{co:3},~\eqref{co:6} and~\eqref{co:7} are satisfied. Then
