    \end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:25:49.853011+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_42d63502471fa5faebc1a7da4a93897dab348e1e80d6ed5ea21033fc37d1f54b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 20 of arXiv:2609.02017, 'Optimal girth-dependent bounds for the Bethe approximation of the permanent'] The function $\varphi$ is an $\mathbf s$--$\mathbf t$ flow on
