{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:33:21.479027+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_43f1174738312d92b973a05c9418c3b1b8cb78a72ac72a9e85a7c9f3509a0d5d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:closed of arXiv:2606.21591, '\textbf{Equal probabilities maximize the expected deficit\\ in the siblings of the coupon '] For every $\mathbf{p}\in\mathcal{P}_N$ and integer $j\ge 2$,
