{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:02:08.152122+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_44e8f00ee0269293801c417af518879a85c87c0b7ed9d9661d58ade983370bea","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 55 of arXiv:2608.27630, 'Oriented planar maps and \\ annular mating of trees'] There exists a constant $C_\gamma>0$, such that 
