		uniformly over all $\gamma_{\mathsf{left}} \in \ensuremath{\mathcal P}_Q(A, A')$, with $\Delta\mathfrak{I}_W(\gamma, \gamma_\mathsf{left})$ defined as in (eq:correction-term of the paper).","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:30:50.736280+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_44ec4d7af2fa24d979af01a80b181383e382f92168141d34409cb0d9ed0cb2d7","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemm_gaussian of arXiv:2503.24372, 'A criterion on the free energy for log-Sobolev inequalities in mean-field particle systems'] For any $G:(\R^{d})^N\to\R_+$ and $\Phi:\bbH\to\R_+$,

\begin{equation}
\E_{\nu^r_T}\Big[ \Phi(\psi)\E_{\mu^{N,\psi}_T}[G(x)]\Big]
=
