{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:46:25.315846+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_459213180a487f5a8c12432c53f211a841aedb8a05ea45d9d62f605e133bcb62","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem ;lpre1 of arXiv:2604.12462, 'Stochastic analysis of Beckner's and related functional inequalities'] Let $\vp \colon (0,\infty )\to \mathbb{R} $ be a $C^{2}$-function. Then, for every 
