{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:29:27.960719+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_45a4bbdd7447bc0a89281e16447b0004a19ef54cae7525391f86efad4c6a874c","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 23 of arXiv:2608.24675, 'Towards Liouville Quantum Gravity on fractals'] Let $|\gamma|<\sqrt{d_H/C_0}$. Then, $\mathbb{P}$-a.s. it holds that:
