{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:52:05.714349+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_45c60485a065147c3a6d0871c0557a6e0e8f073a94e8431293d728a6c6e4199e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem l:300.3.10 of arXiv:2602.21277, 'A Limit in Law for the Cover Time and Last Visited Vertex of Wired Planar Domains'] For any fixed $u \geq 0$, 
