{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:36:23.132713+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_479d01c3457e5ea80675a8aa2e911042d86b13e33734e63299672ecf8393e0d0","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem DevShuf of arXiv:2506.18207, 'Cartan's Path Development, the Logarithmic Signature and a Conjecture of Lyons-Sidorova'] For any $k=1,\cdots,m-1$, one has 
