{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:35:19.870872+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4937183049578b7a4c7cd25d5cefb392be0020266d1abf2bf4531994f23df935","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:distributional of arXiv:2608.24731, 'Optimal Alternating Regret for Online Learning and Games\thanks{Authors are alphabetically'] For every horizon $T\ge1$ and every $\rho\ll\mu$, (alg:main of the paper) guarantees
