{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:01:22.581086+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_496f72cd2499ee7d302cfc22777213bda1945ec863f804a991fba8b5f8027b78","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem Thm-(rho u) of arXiv:2605.16963, 'Stochastic Euler Equations with Pseudo-differential Noise: Continuous and Discontinuous Pe'] Let $d \geq 2$ and $p\ge 1$.  
