{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:57:07.299446+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4b00d6a52f321ee21387788fefed7c1eaefa2612855a103abe794cefbc6a69f3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 14 of arXiv:2606.23383, 'Near-Lipschitz stability of the Kim--Milman flow map'] Let $\nu$ have finite second moment: $\mom(\nu) \le M$. For all $t\ge \delta > 0$ and all $y$ with $\norm y \le R$,
