{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:45:07.258695+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4bd1cdc21df1248a1acbf694d3a401a709eb1d773c3c5b346297dd80f8478cf9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 18 of arXiv:2604.19308, '\textbf{On McKean--Vlasov SDEs with polynomial drifts for SIS epidemic models}'] For $a,b,c\in\R$ and $y\geq 0$ we have
