{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:45:38.340898+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4c141b26399c3ee19683411a69729a12d3720066813b049afa15afe2f913c641","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 (Sparse Erd\H{o}s--R\'enyi graphs: averaged version) of arXiv:2604.20514, 'Macroscopic loops in the random loop model on sparse random graphs'] Fix \(\lambda>0\), \(u\in[0,1]\), and \(\theta>0\), and let \(G_n\sim G(n,\lambda/n)\). Assume
