{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:06:21.712620+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4c793d88f5e6afaa577a97e1f072ed85e4322d091fd10b130ed2b01695b71f81","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 4 ({\cite[Lemma~4.1) of arXiv:2607.21374, 'Local structure at the maximum and sharp persistence asymptotics of rough fractional Brown'] {moench2026horizonProblem}}]

