Similarly we can define the edge rooted version $\mathcal{L}_{U,\mathcal{M}}(\hat{\mathcal{G}}^{\star})$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:05:37.778962+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4e1f561885342b2a00588b59f5c53ca7adab6510d4cba78af5991065cd3c00c9","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:bilinear of arXiv:2608.01253, 'The pseudo-quantum representation of \\finite reversible Markov chains'] The pseudo-wave and pseudo-density obey

