{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:34:45.594507+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4e885681067cf043b7749559810d778b346946798597fdcd1849b9acd148a180","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:boundary of arXiv:2609.01776, 'On the Cuspidal Cohomology of Iwahori Congruence Subgroups of $\mathrm{SL}(3, \mathbb{Z})$'] The dimension of the homology of the boundary of $X^\text{BS}_\mathcal{I}$ is given by the following formula:
