		\int_{\Omega}\sup_n \left[ \mathbb E_{n}\left(\big\|W^{\frac{1}{p}} \widehat{W}_{n}\big\|g\right)\right]^{p'}d\mathbb P\lesssim_{p,d}[W]_{A_p}^{p'}\|g\|_{L_{p'}}^{p'},\quad \forall\, 0\leq g\in L_{p'}.
