{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:30.018465+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_511b6318bef85e3c12cbd62d6e1118e7f404410ca5bb6ea7d402d7f1d253abc1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 38 ({see \cite[Theorem 5.1.3, 5.1.4) of arXiv:2605.05864, 'Classification and Metrization of Classes of Smooth measures'] {FOT11}}]

