{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:28:08.698672+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_52289b27815c84f54e8df69189e3df482f5ae9172fc30926c74eb7b17811f0b3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 20 (Slope-measure representation) of arXiv:2607.29560, 'Tractable Relaxations of Multivariate Stochastic Dominance via Optimal Transport and CVaR'] Let $u$ be a nonconstant increasing concave function on $[0,\overline x]$ with
