    in the collar region $C$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:34:33.535503+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_531f0ea866716cb7af84cc99964883eb2f62ba81532074345504bf1a7860d301","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 5 of arXiv:2603.28170, 'Stabilization time of finite configurations with a second class particle in discrete TASEP'] \begin{enumerate}
