{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:12:46.873984+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5488bee25032ade2343c576314f5b207d40f447d0eb853e3b4c823a4707078a2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma e-excf of arXiv:2608.08375, 'Algebraic formulas for first-passage times of Markov processes in the linear framework: ge'] Under the assumptions made above, the exchange factor $\psi_{k|v,u}$ of the graph $G$ is given by, 
