{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:25:49.871967+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5488f5125cfcea488b15b0ccf804bec331edef9846f3a85f28f7d60a38857a0e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 (\textsf{Quenched switching at the first meeting}) of arXiv:2609.02064, 'Coalescence and fluctuations of O'Connell--Yor polymers\\ via the free-energy correlation '] Fix $\al\in\R$, $\be>0$, and $x,y\in\R$ with $x\neq y$.  Almost
