{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:53:11.412614+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5716304a2e5d02133fca5b474b5fdaee00bb8ad868c1e95a094e2a33c528e0ed","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thmd 4 (\cite{DenRe}) of arXiv:2606.08115, '2606.08115'] Let the assumptions (G) and (M) hold. Then the function
