{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:42:08.418550+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5775486a0839c73a9f0b02862f5352663055e381f35a6fbd9de8b22bbf9414b9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma semiellipse_1 of arXiv:2511.15893, 'On a Class of Dynamical Poisson-Voronoi Tessellations'] For any point $(s,u)\in \cup_{l=1,2}\cup_{i\in \mathbb{N}}C^l_i$, the following holds true: 
