{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:37:20.365819+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_579309f8250073257c5fb9417d4c21a0c222198ddeaaed5137c5ac064d922b60","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm of arXiv:2411.13403, 'Path weighting method for spot sensitivities and its variance reduction'] Formulae ((eq:-19-1 of the paper)) and ((eq:-11 of the paper)) admit
the equivalently adjusted forms 
