{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:39:11.666954+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_58d221e2b3c89eaa90c5f37706b14972bc0bfa6cdb02cc0e22e0098cee65b9c9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 of arXiv:2608.04644, 'Khinchin's and Chung's Laws of the Iterated Logarithm at Time Zero for the Linear Stochast'] Recall that $H$ is defined in \eqref{def:H}. Suppose that Condition \ref{hypo}  holds  and that $H<1$.
