{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:45:05.588013+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_59812c50e9168318d9e6353d0442a93d4bae4bf0e8d8829766b6293310b8bc08","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 2 of arXiv:2608.05842, 'Asymptotic Expansion of the Kallianpur–Striebel Formula under Perturbations of Linear Mode'] Let $\{\xi_t\}_{t\geq 0}$ be a $\mathbb{R}^{d_2}$-dimensional progressively measurable process independent of $W$, and assume
  \begin{align*}
