{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-09T07:38:10+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5c211dc77a4142477e3b45bdd5e9a6a390e56d8ea0f82119b5ad9bf16336a2e3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 2.10 of arXiv:2507.06186, '2507.06186'] Suppose that the hypotheses in Theorem \ref{Theorem: Main}
