{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:54:12.278882+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5dad6842cbe4bd9e50a1f7a6c2e0e53ac940816230194ee1bb72bf3ceb04b005","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem: tight bound on P(q_infty = 0) of arXiv:2603.14163, '\LARGE \bf Tail Bounds for Queues with Abandonment: Constant, Moderate, Large Deviations, '] \textnormal{(Tight Gaussian Tail Bound on $\mathbb{P}(q = 0)$)}
