{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:01:39.494292+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5de73f08920dc97b2de49804ebae502a81ffc5936114580f43d43e19d418c7f0","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:Poisson_fringe of arXiv:2607.22291, 'Rare subtree patterns in size-conditioned Bienaymé trees: Poisson approximation and declum'] Assume that $\mu$ is critical and belongs to the domain of attraction
