{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-05T20:17:54.903408+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5f5dea535322b4ff915c11524410ebcdcce9f4b35f5b69bd626ead04efe5d811","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 (Kac, Pleijel) of arXiv:2507.06186, '2507.06186'] If $\partial D$ is sufficiently regular (e.g., smooth), then
