{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:35:10.792480+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5f6d8146c199a622572428d3ffdb9c38c2569b089a56456b52922788028d8713","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemme 16 of arXiv:2604.00635, 'Large deviations of the periodic Toda chain'] The following relation holds

\bem

\det_{N-1}\big[ \op{A} \big]  \, = \,   | \ln(2\veps_N)|^{N-1}

   \det_N\bigg[  \Big( 1- \frac{1}{\ln(2\veps_N)}  \ln|P^{\prime}(\eta_j)| \Big) \delta_{kj}  + \frac{ N }{ \ln(2\veps_N) } M_{kj} \\

\, +  \, \mathrm{O}\Big( \big( 1+ N \de_{jN} \mathbbm{1}_{k \leq N-1}   \big)\vartheta_N \Big) \bigg]  \, .

\end{multline}

in which the matrix $\op{M}$ is defined as

\begin{align}

M_{kj} \,  =  \, \f{1}{N}\mathbbm{1}_{k \neq j} \ln| \eta_k -\eta_j| \, = \,

    \begin{cases}

\frac{1}{N} \ln|\eta_k - \eta_j| & k \neq j  \vspace{2mm}\\

0 & k = j

\end{cases} \, .

\end{align}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:33:11.969882+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5f748fc2bc2682879de1223597707daabdb1a68b4aa6ccda3537264dcabb1480","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition thm:pn-trajectory-tree-bijection of arXiv:2607.24018, 'Jeu de taquin forests \\ and the inverse infinite RSK correspondence'] For each tree $\tau$ in $\Phi(T)$, its
