{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:58:01.572110+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5f8b5ae4f396d9de2ef587223a3e2ee67e825891ee1ae9b17fcccdacfe41613d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 24 of arXiv:2608.27307, '2608.27307'] Under Assumption~\ref{ass:basic}, let $E_*$ be a regular right edge in the sense of Definition~\ref{def:reg_r_edge}. Then
