{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:25:06.198055+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5fc4cd8557acff739c0e9b4162bffb0dd85bbea175fd9c391e9be632307358df","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 14 (Exponential stability) of arXiv:2608.22636, 'Q-Learning with Stable Infinite-Dimensional \\Linear Function Approximation'] On the event
