        \leq t_\text{mix}(\epsilon)  \leq-\frac{d(n-1)}{2n}\log\left((4\epsilon^2+1)^{1/d}-1\right) 
      \end{multline*} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:18:19.448689+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_608fe305ff3b6c782636d329fe025a628f1e322960e4f68f0a9a5679c7dcd6bf","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:B.3 of arXiv:2508.17838, '\bf Edge Universality for Inhomogeneous Random Matrices'] For the matrix  $V$  in Definition (def:NBP-Wishart of the paper), we have 
