{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:10.193370+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_61b7f6285d286212c7a38dc9475be467d5987962f74e83be0551830165fceb8a","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 12 of arXiv:2605.03851, 'The Relay Random Tree:\\A stochastic geometry approach of multihop relay in an urban visib'] \textbf{Zone of Eventual Relaying.}

