{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:10:05.829298+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_61e299ac52fe65efb9483fcbfeb679bd9f0e7d81991e3b5c65b810ab43d6cd0b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 40 of arXiv:2608.17509, '2608.17509'] For every \(a>1\), \(\Phi_a(0)=0\), \(\Phi_a'(0)=0\), and
