{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:35:10.791878+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_61ef840c698b61bc5fd36291206fbc682ea28427468a9055fc15f72be1d6a47d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 12 of arXiv:2604.00635, 'Large deviations of the periodic Toda chain'] Let $\mathcal{I}$ be defined by \eqref{density}. Then, one has

