{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:09:49.781683+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6322077533607590e87b9aee9376bf4d555e8313fad2c4a867907a5f8fde800a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 5 of arXiv:2609.03054, 'The classes of bivariate Schur and Herglotz matrix-valued rational functions: realizations'] Let $F:\DD^2\to\Cmats{m}{n}$ be a rational matrix function satisfying
