{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:04:40.964076+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_635e71f2f7e3a75a154d17928e0bc3a1d4c937a1af65f1c833c28654472c30fe","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition D:Rho of arXiv:2412.03521, 'On ergodic properties of stochastic PDEs'] A function $\rho:\mathbb{R}^d\mapsto \mathbb{R}$ is called an \textup{admissible weight
