	\item ${\cal{I}}^{\boldsymbol{F}}$ is distributed as a weighted random recursive tree of size $\tau^{\boldsymbol{F}}$, and random weights $(W_m)_{m\geq 1}$, defined in the same way as in Proposition (proposition_subcritical_structure of the paper).
