{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:32:58.358591+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_65140a6535911eeaec31f170aba8da6c79001e6ced7db124408d728c29866021","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 13 of arXiv:2506.18834, '\large\bf On the random-time and finite-time ruin probability for widely dependent claim s'] In the above nonstandard renewal risk model, let $Y_i,i\geq 1$ be ENOD random variables with dominating coefficient $M_G$.
