{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:47:07.703018+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_652573c0aa7ac8fe539b9b8b30f34de30b6d6833ffb75be6ef9e73481815a7be","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 7 of arXiv:2608.06038, 'Efron type identities\\ for stopping sets and Poisson hulls'] Let $B\in\cX_0$.  Let $f\colon \N_0\times\R_+\to\R_+$ be measurable
