{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:41:29.041422+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_65346cac8a404f3224c8f6b3f4015fdf1b13ec2933113efd66f45b11a9713ed2","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 5 (Definition 3.1 of \cite{Chen2024}) of arXiv:2608.26598, 'Pinching cones for positive isotropic curvature in dimensions seven and eight'] For $0<b\le b_{max,2}$, let $\mathcal{E}(b)$ denote the set of all algebraic curvature tensors $S$
