{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:47:22.254688+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6582f9372e526f686728704735a912922c388181e0f02da62e0bdb6cbf5eea3d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 97 of arXiv:2605.26664, 'Mixing times for Glauber dynamics of lozenge tilings of the hexagon'] We have w.o.p. that the following statements hold for all $t \in [\mathsf{T}', N^5]$. 

