{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:57:07.298762+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_65f063e83c258bcb200f097f2310b9fd94104175e6efc9d4d1846f87c64b4438","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 5 of arXiv:2606.23383, 'Near-Lipschitz stability of the Kim--Milman flow map'] Suppose that $\mu,\nu \in \cP_2(\R^d)$ satisfy~\eqref{theta}, and let $(\theta_t)_{t\ge 0}$ denote the corresponding constants for $\mu$.
