{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:37:51.460499+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_65fe55c0da94955b38906ef4a982b5895c32f2527e51a9ed047ea61545b139ae","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 51 of arXiv:2604.03777, 'Equilibrium fluctuations for a multi-species particle system with long jumps'] Assume $\gamma\in(1,2)$. Then, there exist constants $\hat{C} = \hat{C}
