{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:34:09.925115+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_66511d6e63c5b83e3f40e8089f22d4c8a16b61b5610b4e6dad72543b9c04ecd1","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 15 (Fourier transform of $\xi_M$ and $\xi_M^c$) of arXiv:2603.27433, 'The $k$-cycle shuffling with repeated cards'] We have
\[
\widehat{\xi_M}(\lambda)
=
\frac{K_{\lambda,\mu}+K_{\lambda',\mu}}{d_\lambda}\,\Id_{d_\lambda}, \quad\widehat{\xi_M^c}(\lambda)
