{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:46:36.095683+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_67291ad1901685ea0fef8931957486f71c30ddbbebe7e8e4f98e5890b4858077","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lem_black of arXiv:2609.02795, 'Global smooth behavior in Kuznetsov and Westervelt type\\ viscous wave equations:\\ A unif'] Let $\kappa\in\mathbb{R}$ denote the maximum of the curvatures on $\partial\Omega$. 
