{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:42:39.077015+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_69686c597313a98dcbb6d03181f602f43814934b78f0155f117a0a50cd44ede2","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Dfn of arXiv:2412.08236, 'Aging and sub-aging for Bouchaud trap models on resistance metric spaces'] Define 
