{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:49:25.046973+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_69772ca01f0cd9033658940666cc1605c738a739ed6062a361ea9d0f41dcfcf0","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:gap of arXiv:2609.03448, 'Prime-power Diophantine tuples'] Assume that $N>2^{2^{117}}$. After the lower-bound reduction of
