Equality holds precisely when $\operatorname{cnul}_h(A)=0$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:36:44.552167+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_697d1d7aaa427204efda747f63c67c3cc6ce6568392fa0ef9a2dea271dee962b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 25 of arXiv:2604.01978, 'Homogenized Transformers'] For $\bA=\frac{1}{d\sigma_{\bA}^{2}}\bW^{\sT}\bW'$, we have 
