{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:48:47.284699+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_69b3ded28ec0f181cee6a522b6a6558b8e99fc86d3d76163fe7b9c312d3eb3e1","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm cor:smc-jump-chain of arXiv:2604.20629, 'Rates of forgetting for the sequentially Markov coalescent'] Let $K_{\mathrm{SMC}}$ be the jump kernel
