{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:41:19.334989+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_69f13739558048d9cf33f4389948d69e75629e515d70427c9333ddd8f0301b0e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor uniform exploration from x of arXiv:2609.04138, 'The conformally invariant metric on $\CLE_4$ I:\\ subsequential limits of the non-simple C'] Jointly with the convergences~(equation eq cv subsequence of the paper) and~(equation eq cv Hausdorff ball of the paper), along a subsequence which is again denoted by $(\kappa_n)_{n \ge 0}$,
