{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:34:20.797840+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6b394f25843d4a9a533ac92d83ee6f007373f39094ed029484dd998f3d90c35a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theo 22 of arXiv:2609.02261, 'Quantization and process'] Let  $L$ be a homogeneous differential operator of order 2 with constant coefficients. Then, there exists $C>0$ satisfying if 
