{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:49:17.502928+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6d12b3f9194c24a4e369eb7072c1ac791f3db43f067dc568bbedc3651780d0e2","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 27 (Boosting pair of boundary conditions) of arXiv:2605.30030, 'Critical exponents for planar random-cluster model with cluster-weight~$q=4$'] A \emph{boosting pair} of boundary conditions for an inner or outer flower domain~$\mathcal{F}$ with at least four petals 
