{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:29:00.770353+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6e75257abaf8c52ef5d58d0723ab844f6a3c12f3bf4314c8d57c5a03f8bf41bc","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 3 of arXiv:2512.05340, 'The rate of convergence of the critical mean-field $O(N)$ magnetization via multivariate n'] Suppose $V$ satisfies Assumption \ref{assumption: assumptions on V}, and let $\mu$ have Lebesgue density proportional to
