{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:18.055810+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_703a598066526c7a687dfec54b584e73ec6e3faa8164a4a16cd0ff79aa084932","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 16 (Differentiability of $\bar F_N$) of arXiv:2606.16636, 'Free energy of non-convex multi-species spin glasses with centered Ising spins'] Let $N \in \N$ and let $\bar F_N$ be given as in~\eqref{e.F_N(t,q)=}. We have for every $t,t' \in \R_+$ and $q,q' \in \mcl Q_\infty^\sS$ that 
