{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:32:29.005110+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_71f429578cd58b732f73c499e62c9ffb9116339350bb053e2ab3147a4e51d179","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem typP poly UB of arXiv:2608.25471, 'Exact Hausdorff measures and fine geometry of collisions of independent Markov processes'] For all sufficiently large $\ell \in \mathbb{N}$, the following holds.
