{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:41:03.317078+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7232cf3d3541a7e054859eca638e287ac49dcf7f315e7d0c2e8fbb08dc355c4c","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem tflbadm of arXiv:2411.09005, 'On Time-Changed Linear Birth-Death Process with Immigration at Extinction'] For $t\ge0$, the series components of the state probabilities of TFLBPwI are given by
