{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:52:47.255103+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_72a06cfef06de483052edb595dc9ae6bc6cb3b450fdd1eff15adfd991481ddda","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 7 of arXiv:2609.01101, '2609.01101'] For every $\epsilon>0$,
