{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:26:26.806247+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_739323aac1d836c8363d91e5ea3350ce919f7f54390da648f6919db04e9897e6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:le-cam-inequality of arXiv:2608.06159, 'Majority Dynamics on Resampled Sparse Erd\H{o}s--R\'enyi Graphs:\\[0.5ex] Gaussian Winner '] Let \(\xi_1,\ldots,\xi_n\) be independent Bernoulli random variables with
