  where \( {{C = C(L,\kappa,\alpha,\delta,T)}} \) is a positive constant.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:54:57.589020+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_76aef2b858981c6cda8d6c0c21845f0a57ac653833cbf0497c2f8e94cd84e8e6","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition Prop:emb of arXiv:2412.03366, 'Regularity of Weighted Tensorized Fractional Brownian Fields and associated function space'] For  $0 <p,q \leq \infty$, $s \in \mathbb{R}$  and $0 \le \alpha \le 1$, one has
