{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:16:46.765476+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7caba30b55efe59115a89f5b0e9c98997d61e0c3e44763dd01bf4767fe21dabc","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defi GKato of arXiv:2411.19543, 'Feller property and convergence for semigroups of time-changed processes'] {\rm Let $\mu$ be a positive Radon measure on $X$. 
