{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:06:21.713416+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7cef5e4a15d6d91eade45caf9464df320998641c04a237d5c04d6ab8e8f07904","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 of arXiv:2607.21374, 'Local structure at the maximum and sharp persistence asymptotics of rough fractional Brown'] Fix finite nonempty \(T\subset\mathbb D\), and choose \(N_T\) so that
