{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:35:57.006797+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7d691358d25207b9e18197da9cd72855de66c62e0d59406b27a348a2920d6987","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:dir_E[deg-edges] of arXiv:2604.05921, 'Simplicity of random hypergraphs'] For a uniformly random directed hypergraph with degree sequence $\vb*{d}$,
    \begin{align*}
         \mathds{E}[DH_n] &= |E| -  \sum_{e \in E} \frac{\delta_e^{\textnormal{tail}}!\delta_e^{\textnormal{head}}!(n\mathds{E}[d_v^{\textnormal{out}}]-\delta_e^{\textnormal{tail}})!(n\mathds{E}[d_v^{\textnormal{in}}]-\delta_e^{\textnormal{head}})!}{(n\mathds{E}[d_v^{\textnormal{out}}])!(n\mathds{E}[d_v^{\textnormal{in}}])!}\\
         &\quad \times \sum_{\substack{\vb*{a} \in \mathds{N}^{\delta_e^{\textnormal{tail}}}:\\ \sum_{i=1}^{\delta_e^{\textnormal{tail}}}ia_i= \delta_e^{\textnormal{tail}}}} (-1)^{\sum_{i=1}^{\delta_e^{\textnormal{tail}}}(i-1)a_i}  \prod_{i=1}^{\delta_e^{\textnormal{tail}}}  \Bigg( \frac{1}{a_i!}\Big(\frac{n\mathds{E}[(d_v^{\textnormal{out}})^i]}{i}\Big)^{a_i} \Bigg)\\
