{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:37:08.953219+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7e80438c9e6f10eca9fb99249a2eeec48ce5d0461f994aa37a5f55c269f68502","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:empirical_current of arXiv:2609.01581, 'Concentration of additive functionals of Stratonovich-type'] For a bounded, continuously differentiable vector field with bounded
