{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:32:19.921309+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7e8645d7bbe07318dc10fd8e2f7a0eaf630031284422f99f939ce65522be0dd7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 of arXiv:2608.02927, 'Thinning Operation via the Poisson-F\"ollmer Process'] [Harrem\"oes, Johnson and Kontoyiannis \cite{HJK1}] 
