{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:58.702732+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7e8b2d07f4a7f4bfb84e80778e46228cead22e91dc33c6882cfc6af6f51fd35b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:transition of arXiv:2510.22778, 'Free denoising diffusion models'] Let $\rho=\tfrac12(\delta_{-a}+\delta_{a})$ and $\nu=\rho\boxplus\gamma_{v}$, $v>0$.
