{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:47:21.665518+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_801abbef10fe34dfffa4d1a1a2e07934f5509da77f4288e5fe97668b542c0d06","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:locprob of arXiv:2412.09145, 'Asymptotic expansions for normal deviations of random walks conditioned to stay positive'] Under the conditions of Theorem (thm:lattice of the paper) one has for $z=x/\sigma$
