{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:31:57.839354+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_82307f8abe88c365f388db341209b95a748fe9c9573429136768c747e33c9285","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:JX-JX:t of arXiv:2510.00214, 'On the local well-posedness of randomly forced reaction-diffusion equations with $\bm{L^2}'] Choose and fix arbitrary numbers $\alpha,\delta\in(0\,,1)$
