{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:26:26.799020+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_85edc11eb6aed442bee3a5f95fef6f2ee8f16572b29547943956ab9165bc17e2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:expected-variance-degree-differences of arXiv:2608.06159, 'Majority Dynamics on Resampled Sparse Erd\H{o}s--R\'enyi Graphs:\\[0.5ex] Gaussian Winner '] Under Assumption~(ass:sparse-er of the paper), whenever both camps are nonempty, the expected degree differences on day $t$ are
