{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:53:31.973054+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_872d301c6ef27bb458e3fed83a85c0589e3da7b1eb5fc3e533f59bb59360a370","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 3 (\cite{Pit99}, Corollary 5) of arXiv:2606.10336, 'From Pitman's local times representation to the Gorin-Shkolnikov identity and beyond'] The process $\{\ell_x\}_{x \ge 0}$ solves the SDE:
