{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:56:11.137532+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_87fa523a6756dc0f8fb0f3bf95ecf139965a9eb762551fdeb6c7c5077ed70fd9","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 4 (Infinitesimal range evolution) of arXiv:2608.10992, '2608.10992'] At level $t$, conditionally on $X_t=x<\infty$, the update rate is
