{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:25:41.601089+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_89fa114ddfaaec2d5fd96e17eabe8ad783b49e6e7f4660e3ea578ca25de202de","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 20 of arXiv:2608.12947, 'Branch-stationary max-stable fields on rooted trees'] Let \(Z\) be an \(\alpha\)-spectral representer satisfying
