{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:30:50.729828+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8abd674932dca1da626bcca359ce44ee607835e30bc829a14d035763eeda368e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem opt-is-path-length of arXiv:2503.22334, 'Probabilistic analysis of optimal multi-pivot QuickSort'] Define the sequence $(\Psi_n)_{n≥0}$ recursively as
