{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:33.751322+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8b43b76abe73fb7cadaabefa8f9f05b48c53a9196b2c76b021071160cb34214e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 28 (Moment Formulas) of arXiv:2608.18834, 'The Parabolic Anderson Model's Total Mass at Small Times: Geometry, Fluctuations, and Reno'] Let $\ka,\th>0$.
Let us denote
