{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:33:06.542418+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8c8725bd8ea5a00b5570332bd3d7eb3a65026850426eaaf3cae502433c5306f0","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 of arXiv:2608.25971, 'Positive \texorpdfstring{$\tau$}{tau}-bi-Ricci curvature and Mean curvature flow with surg'] Let $M_0\in\CC_{\tau,\kappa}(R,\alpha)$, assume that
