simultaneously for all $\gamma \in [0, C_9]$. The constant $c$ depends on $C_9$ and the parameters of Remark~\ref{r:fp-rpr}. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:58:40.868336+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8d00e631a91cf851d8082320831928aca52675b179b67d9943a4211ac2d064ca","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop_1725 of arXiv:2605.10479, 'Poisson approximation of random lattices'] Let $\varphi:\mathcal F(\mathbb R^n)\to [0,\infty)$ be a function such that
