{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:09.850874+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8d142fb24fc444f9175396f1d4dab06cc7758a7db297d352d72f9c5b421371cc","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 5 of arXiv:2605.18751, '\mytitle'] Let $X$ be a random variable with law $P_\nu$. For every \(x\in J\) with \(\bar F_\nu(x)>0\),
