{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:49:21.122468+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8eb796a00453432e524ec472febd76c706cc87ea2859fd4e617bda224a148d57","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 22 of arXiv:2608.26642, '2608.26642'] For $y\in \R$, we have
