{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:05:28.080820+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8f45f14d888bd1f9af4f327c60b23900940f4be0d1e6205235a19e37e5841712","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem th:reciproquegamarnik of arXiv:2601.20502, 'Optimal matching under size priority'] Under the same notation and hypothesis as Theorem~(maintheorem2 of the paper), assume furthermore that for any random variable $X$ taking values in $[0,1]$, we have that
