{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:33:46.769010+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_90f7bd306fbd8afd982905b47d6fe3dbf2ee66994cfd72ffe94cb8d19d06c3e9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 25 of arXiv:2603.24616, 'Pinning in non-critical half-space geometric last passage percolation'] Assume the same notation as in Definition \ref{Def.IPGP}. Then, for any $\{ B_i \in \Omega(T,y_i) \}_{i = 1}^{2k}$
