{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:47:07.704248+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_911222599ea735fc7339be56958f563cff8332a5766b096ac82f27e89d0dd74b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 10 of arXiv:2608.06038, 'Efron type identities\\ for stopping sets and Poisson hulls'] Let $Z$ be a Markov set. Then
  \begin{equation}
