{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:45:07.257549+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9d462e4a319784c85ffaea8a05c4eb041e0564e8adbbf59d1e212f9ded65e945","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 6 of arXiv:2604.19308, '\textbf{On McKean--Vlasov SDEs with polynomial drifts for SIS epidemic models}'] Let~\eqref{co:6} hold and $\rho > 0$ be such that
