{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:41:03.317630+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9d64e5f4d24760b697f377d489517ffc64d0b7ee30ab1d48b2e8fcfe68d40310","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem tflbppmf of arXiv:2411.09005, 'On Time-Changed Linear Birth-Death Process with Immigration at Extinction'] The state probabilities of TFLBPwI are 
