{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:54:15.648638+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9e1281ba6c29c740309f207448eb5a2dc9c6508ab923656ea84270d89e4620c7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 of arXiv:2608.09419, 'Left-tail expansions for Schr\"oder branching processes with explicit convergence rates'] \lb{mainT} The following expansion holds
