{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:41:33.827411+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9ead321b55220055735312a6eea92ea9c05d7e2528b61bef3fa769aac155c03a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 1 of arXiv:2604.10395, 'A remark on the comparison of the sum and the maximum of positive random variables'] Assume that $X_1$ has a strictly positive density $f$ supported on
