\end{align}
If, in addition, $q_{\mathrm{hi}}=\Pi_{\mathrm{hi}}q_{\mathrm{hi}}$ belongs to
the same graph class and satisfies the ellipticity-controlled comparison
\begin{equation}
 \norm{q_{\mathrm{hi}}}_{\gamma_d}
