{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:10:07.472549+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9f336da76f762b0adabaf5e13a7d1b3ce0ba4f2d1bcf03e54f4c8800f993f4b1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:sph-grad of arXiv:2607.27613, 'Regularized Bulk Universality versus Bounded-Disorder Nonuniversality\\for Annealed Comple'] \label[lemma]{lem:spherical-derivatives}
For \(v,w\in T_\sigma\mathbb S_N\),
\begin{align}
 \nabla_SF(\sigma)&=P_\sigma\nabla F(\sigma),\\
