{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:02:28.580282+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a1d41765aaecfe4769fed2c13f73630a03099bb946047befd62e8621f6073528","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 10 of arXiv:2609.01296, 'Asymptotic safety regions for Gabor frames generated by Hermite functions'] Let $0< \delta < \eta < \frac{1}{3}$, and $S_n(\delta,\eta)$ be defined by \eqref{eq:diagonal_safety_region}. Let $K$ denote the set
