{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:00:22.782519+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a1d83f5cdc1965d312735abe0a63386475c696c392021b4f21d910e08758e6ca","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lm Tightness Lemma of arXiv:2411.01633, 'On the Limit of the Tridiagonal Model \\for $\beta$-Dyson Brownian Motion'] Fixing a $\delta>0$, for $n$ large enough we have
