{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:00:22.779763+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a29be06c9646c0fc4c4c468365568c11741199bf9d23865eed16337e4037776e","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn Stationary Radial Ornstein Uhlenbeck process SDE of arXiv:2411.01633, 'On the Limit of the Tridiagonal Model \\for $\beta$-Dyson Brownian Motion'] The normalized stationary radial Ornstein--Uhlenbeck process $\mathrm{ROU}_d(m)$, is the unique solution to 
