{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:54:12.279644+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a39fda0b7394afe8d3550f030560cbab7dd6336ea57ced62c364a8a8639da8ef","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition pro: zero probability sum for JSQ of arXiv:2603.14163, '\LARGE \bf Tail Bounds for Queues with Abandonment: Constant, Moderate, Large Deviations, '] \textnormal{(Probability Mass at Zero)}

