{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:19:47.320465+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a584364339fe8460bf49b112f84c62878ed07fb1122b06f798e3468e215e8f69","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma of arXiv:2602.11129, 'Information-Theoretic Thresholds for Bipartite Latent-Space Graphs Under Noisy Observation'] Given any $r_1, \ldots, r_k \in \alpha \times \alpha$, set $\gamma \coloneqq {\textsc{Supp}}(r_1, \ldots, r_k)$. Then for any $\beta \subseteq \alpha$ and all $\mathbf{t}$, we have 
