{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:52:17.370064+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a7d50b81580f9cf7f99746386c5f0cb8809d321fe708c2a7f35168ac70124759","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 20 of arXiv:2606.03534, 'Construction and simulation of a path-valued model of dendrite development'] When $\ell_t$ is a Brownian motion absorbed at $\ell=0$ we have 
