{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:58:01.571150+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a8a50ead5689b6431bee24d9e7820e03b7b9689e4a7cf38817b8421cf29079e2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 16 of arXiv:2608.27307, '2608.27307'] Under Assumption~\ref{ass:basic}, uniformly for $z\in\mb D(\tau,\eta_0)$,
