{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:13:49.970957+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a922e61920c889079056ddf94bad09522d07b25091c2512284bdbc6cda0a1c81","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:G_mu of arXiv:2411.07157, 'Rough differential equations in the flow approach'] Fix a smooth, increasing function $\chi:\R\rightarrow[0,1]$ 
