{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:07:15.776545+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a9fb81016bc46aea3d3c885acfe3c1eeccc066f091745dd1fc7b193f5149b892","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:NBS of arXiv:2608.05089, 'Correlation decay in area-tilted line ensembles'] Suppose that $\mu$ is a {probability} {measure} on $\Omega \subseteq \mathbb{R}^N$ such
