{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:44:24.743044+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ab93a152ee75c5bcae9b3582590763d0f37d5d96bdac7decf026dc5e1b433d4c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:f_c of arXiv:2605.05193, 'Grokability in five inequalities'] As in Nazarov [Nazarov2003], define
