 &+C_2\frac{B_{\gamma_M}(\mathcal H_m(\ve,M)+\log(2/\delta))}{n} \nonumber\\
 &\quad +C_3\omega_m(\ve,M)+C_4
 \varepsilon_{\mathrm{opt},M}
\end{align}
with some positive constants \(C_i\), \(i\in\{1,2,3,4\}\). (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:13:18.508627+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_aeb83d6fcf49f334a44f447991d2ddb5c670635b2535d0ae579f31548e799d29","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 20 of arXiv:2608.30589, 'Vector-Valued Wavelet Bases as Hilbert $\mathbb{M}_m(\mathbb{R})$-Module Bases: A Construc'] Let $(\phi_1,\phi_2)$ and $(\psi_1,\psi_2)$ be an orthonormal $2$-multiwavelet system in $L^2(\mathbb{R})$
