{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:10.193947+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_affd0eeef3948cd0f3bd9d13ca2b0995563f98342e5f00e4f2ecc35863db0d7b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 18 of arXiv:2605.03851, 'The Relay Random Tree:\\A stochastic geometry approach of multihop relay in an urban visib'] \textbf{Buildings being relayed by a given building.}

