{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:28:49.121482+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b12493adc2753a7ec4fd7e044e2ee78443e7e78ed4452ab54698fc69e8959ddd","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:main of arXiv:2608.18293, 'Critical tensor covariance at the Marchenko--Pastur threshold'] Assume (equation eq:base-assumptions of the paper) and (equation eq:critical-scaling of the paper). Then the
