{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:25:12.185959+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b2e67a28912dd23088a2ce2b610f73c2e6904e95b1f694857ead986e6f07367a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 of arXiv:2510.20492, 'Heterochromatic two-arm probabilities for metric graph Gaussian free fields'] For $d\ge 3$, $n\ge 1$, $D\subset \widetilde{\mathbb{Z}}^d$, and $v,w\in \widetilde{\mathbb{Z}}^d$ with $\mathrm{dist}(D,\{v,w\})\ge n$, 
