{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:06:21.750054+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b626c1b89c5a081d9f6ef2e20d522636fe1bb8933ed149c4d23503974fef4be2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 39 of arXiv:2607.21374, 'Local structure at the maximum and sharp persistence asymptotics of rough fractional Brown'] For every fixed \(t\in(0,\infty)\cap\mathbb D\),
