    This system is \textbf{$\bm \partial$-full} if for each point $p \in \partial_* M_{\mathord{\scalebox{0.45}{$\square$}}}$, the leaf of $\partial \mathcal{F}_{\mathord{\scalebox{0.45}{$\square$}}}$ passing through $p$ intersects interiors of initial intervals of $\partial$-ribbons, or interiors of windows, on both sides of $p$.","status":"unverified"}

