\end{enumerate} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:48:43.534182+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ba6b760b75ab1ec3aa10613910b6c37b665a77e70b10948537aa2614917d6534","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 7 of arXiv:2608.06646, 'Three-dimensional stochastic wave equation with non-Lipschitz coefficients'] Let $E_n$ be defined in~\eqref{E:EventsEn}. Then, we have that
