{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:17:42.302351+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ba9e819ac2b54e96a967f58a09589a6ae2c6c68927fd5ab9404127754e660069","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn 25 of arXiv:2510.22155, 'Random walks in space-time random media in all spatial dimensions: the full subcritical fl'] Let $  {\boldsymbol v}\in \mathbb R^d$. We define the function $\z_{  {\boldsymbol v}}:I\to \mathbb R$ by 
