{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:32:19.921877+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bb824b855f8bca0d14034e186cf22b1b763a27100ae5c62b054529a11828095a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 10 of arXiv:2608.02927, 'Thinning Operation via the Poisson-F\"ollmer Process'] [Aryan, L\'opez--Rivera and Shenfeld \cite{ARS}]

