\end{equation}
as $n \to \infty$ followed by $k \to \infty$, uniformly over all measurable $f_k: {\rm D} \times \mathbb{R}^{{\rm Q}(k)} \to \mathbb{R}$ with $\|f_k\|_\infty \leq 1$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

