{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:24:34.395869+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bbd2c297c2ab4442d219e71d157f68655a741a7987448cbf466d0f87af5e63a6","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 8 (Refined \cref{thm:intro-static}) of arXiv:2608.31008, 'Stability of gravitational instantons with a bounded Killing vector field'] Let $(M^4,g)$ be connected, oriented and Ricci-flat, and let $K\not\equiv0$ be a
