{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:42:57.240765+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bc976ab00a07055495e4b93223d7e2e6671d7d2045a87ffa09fe53586f5b842b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:training-geometry of arXiv:2608.20295, 'Physical-Support Confidence Sets for Highly Coherent Dictionaries'] Under Assumption~(ass:frozen-shell of the paper), there exist constants
