{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:39:12.321809+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bed2e78f27cc8c907daf6d26cc279bce663b5c4699c3e5da8fbf0d623232c711","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:results:2measures of arXiv:2412.07710, 'An H-theorem for a conditional McKean-Vlasov process related to interacting diffusions on '] Let $\nu \in \mathcal{M}_{2, d}$. Define the \emph{lift map} to be the absolutely continuous measure $\psi_\nu^n \in  \mathcal{P}((\ensuremath{\mathbb{R}}^d)^{V_n})$ with density
