{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:54:57.593457+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bff487ea18e7e03028284710ac45fb007d58cb8353623bbb019dfa00c2dea742","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 6.3 of arXiv:2412.03370, 'TASEP with a general initial condition and a deterministically moving wall'] Suppose Assumption~(assumpt:2.9 of the paper) is fulfilled and define $ J_\varkappa \coloneqq \{(\alpha - d^{-2})T - \varkappa T^{2/3}, \dots, (\alpha-d^{-2})T + \varkappa T^{2/3}\}$.
