{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-09-07T12:18:17.977845+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c0593d5f03bc447aea068c4eaae01c35d53837a73ff19fe8904ae3d5684440a3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 9 of arXiv:2507.06186, '2507.06186'] Suppose that the hypotheses in Theorem \ref{Theorem: Main}
