{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:01:39.494875+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c07b14398ba3c1fb2b6e252ab5da29ef3310e2b585882d51996fb56fb1643aac","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:consequenceM of arXiv:2607.22291, 'Rare subtree patterns in size-conditioned Bienaymé trees: Poisson approximation and declum'] Let $(G_k)$ be a sequence of $\{0,1\}$-valued functions on finite plane trees,
