{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:53:10.212108+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c47ed42347a56ebc780ca510ff8dc696e267fbdf79006bd930479eb90c6197cb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem high-randomization of arXiv:2608.29018, 'Sharp Restricted Isometry Thresholds for\\ Global Minima of Rank-Restricted Matrix LASSO'] There is a finitely supported random
