{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:21:06.854422+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c4f4697997fbfabd725a9dabefb99943c816f4b3ab6f0a4dcfd3c2ef47d3794e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 9 (Uniform Ginibre power bound) of arXiv:2608.20998, 'Free-Probability Kernels for Zero-Rollout Hyperparameter Selection in Reservoir Computing'] Let
