\begin{equation}
 V_k=\prod_{0\le i<j\le k}(x_j-x_i),
 \qquad V_0=1.
\end{equation}
Then
\begin{equation}
 h_k=\frac{\Delta_k(f)}{V_k}.
\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

