{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:07:15.764985+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ca96e8a7531e36809264a1f9383af778a739f9a45db2fd90b30dda379ec7934e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:lbm-active-response-multiplicity of arXiv:2608.02459, 'Response Calculus for Spectral Simplicity\\ and Joint Eigenvalue Densities'] For $x\in\Omega_{\rm LBM}$ and an eigenvalue $\Lambda>0$ of multiplicity $r$,
