\end{equation}
with $C^{\text{\rm\ref{thm:high-order-Lp-Lq-energy-Boolean}}}(p,q) = \left(M(p)^{-\frac{2}{p}}+\frac{pq}{4\upe(2-q)}\right)^{-\frac{p}{2}}  \gtrsim 2-q$, where $M(p) := p \, 2^{-\frac{p}{2}} \max_{x\geq 0} \frac{1-\upe^{-x}}{x^{p/2}}$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

