\right)^\frac{2}{q}
\\
\leq 
\inf_{\omega\in\ell^\infty(X)}
\sup_{A}\euler^{-\omega}
\sup_{B}\euler^{\omega}
\left(
\fint_I
\tvert{P_\tau^\omega}_{A,A,2,q}^q
\drm \tau
\right)^\frac{1}{q}
