{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:33:06.543116+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ce14a12171c62235d2c52faadd62e4f00e010a843a10579e7a5cefd7a05bfe66","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 18 (Higher derivatives) of arXiv:2608.25971, 'Positive \texorpdfstring{$\tau$}{tau}-bi-Ricci curvature and Mean curvature flow with surg'] For every pair of nonnegative integers $a,b$, there exists
