{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:33:46.772320+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ce9d88fd43d4c59e24086b53e4e0411b470da4a287423bac3b46268b258bac27","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 54 of arXiv:2603.24616, 'Pinning in non-critical half-space geometric last passage percolation'] Assume the notation in Lemma \ref{Lem.PowerSeriesSG}. There exist constants $\delta_2 \in (0,\delta_0]$ and $\epsilon_2 > 0$, depending on $q, \kappa, c$, such that for $r \in [0, \delta_2]$
