{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:10:08.703225+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ced9e9cfba64caa4fe0df8e17fa6d6fd7ba97c0b6801b328ce66a71ef5bbba74","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem th_hydrodynamics of arXiv:2411.17653, 'Exclusion processes with non-reversible boundary: hydrodynamics and large deviations'] {(Hydrodynamic Limit)}
