{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:07:48.563685+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ceefcaf4a54c0b4498ac0fbd6ec8e31d53bf639007c566c9cf6c7e7453c71ab3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 9 (The $m$th-order Santal\'o inequality on $\R^n$) of arXiv:2609.01460, 'On cost-induced Santal\'o-type inequalities \\ in Polish measure spaces'] Fix $Q\in\conbodo[m].$ Let $K\subset \R^n$ be a compact set of positive volume such that $K$ or $K^\circ$ has center of mass at the origin. Then,
