{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:32:23.873366+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cfcfdd8bbaaba3ae73fc35fea9a13888c416b885cd113c4e7d1a3fca3930fc48","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma trunc of arXiv:2603.26307, '\LARGE The incompressible Navier--Stokes--Fourier system with thermal noise'] Consider a normed vector space $\mathscr{X}$ and let $R>0$. Then the mapping 
