{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:07:15.762183+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d24900fde96c55622333d669b691c2f919598b1f169d6533aedf72aa05ef375b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:lbm-cluster-response of arXiv:2608.02459, 'Response Calculus for Spectral Simplicity\\ and Joint Eigenvalue Densities'] For these branches, the response operator has matrix
