{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:30:14.218514+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d2548d08a6946cf85e7cd0d6651f1889add7289ec96398b1eacfc1072f5b6f74","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:local of arXiv:2608.20537, 'Persistent anisotropy in multi-dimensional\\ branching Brownian motion'] Let $\Gamma$ denote a ball in $S^{d-1}$ centered at $\h \theta$.
