{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:25:41.601014+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d6acd9e85eea2c35f71222afced3938168cec021f164fb3253cacafbe89aaf1b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 13 of arXiv:2608.12947, 'Branch-stationary max-stable fields on rooted trees'] Let \(Z\) be an \(\alpha\)-spectral representer satisfying
(equation 2 of the paper), and let \(\eta\) be given by
