{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:37:25.945079+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d73ea4c828680e031513c7b42df780e356f9b1ffe47281ef41199aa0525717a7","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 53 (Colored Newton lift) of arXiv:2608.29585, '2608.29585'] For every zero-framed knot $K$ and every $n\ge2$, the series
