{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:57:51.763465+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d8f5da67fdcf9283abeba026b4f9059e15fd6409d0271915259dfb8a4f2f5eaf","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 3 (Parameter-uniform curvature correction) of arXiv:2608.30211, '2608.30211'] Assume \eqref{eq:f-assumptions} and that $\Omega$ is bounded, connected, and
