{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:32:11.127656+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_da30075f2fa1a6d939f818006d325d3f10046280a1d6290d584a3eec362b0646","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:maintechnicalbit_proof of arXiv:2510.06891, 'Multivariate CLT for L\'evy processes: convergence rates without moment assumptions'] Let $\ell$ as in Lemma~(lem:reg_vary_mu+finitemoment of the paper)(a). Then, under the assumptions of Theorem~(thm:int-3_one-dim_version of the paper), we have
