{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:32:19.950426+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_de30b48e391130c759216de7bb4fbf8295a926bbb28884bfb2bc28f729a444af","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 34 of arXiv:2608.02927, 'Thinning Operation via the Poisson-F\"ollmer Process'] [Aryan, L\'opez-Rivera and Shenfeld \cite{ARS}]

