{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:32:19.937304+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e0b88410215e39c8755ed8fe3b4e54bcd68242bec6e915750745ef07c8c40607","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 16 of arXiv:2608.02927, 'Thinning Operation via the Poisson-F\"ollmer Process'] Let $T = \E X >0$ and $X \sim f \dd \pi_{T}.$  
