{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:58:01.573813+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e14cf6e9d8841bde64314abe6fbad3e9a00e93300004c537f8bc595b82625d1e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 42 of arXiv:2608.27307, '2608.27307'] Under Assumptions~\ref{ass:basic} and~\ref{ass:rand_ent}, let $E_*$ be a regular right edge in the sense of Definition~\ref{def:reg_r_edge}. Fix $z\in\mb D_*^{\eps_*}(\tau)$. Suppose that, for some fixed $\delta>0$ satisfying $7\delta<\tau$, some constants $C,c>0$, and a deterministic $\te\in[N^{-C},N^{-c}]$,
