{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:57:28.726188+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e15b4144ea8fa2abf5d454038cc0a1d709599f2d8ff5a6cbbd7d500e76cb7018","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 29 of arXiv:2609.01190, 'Rough differential equations on manifolds via natural bundles'] The estimate 
