$(G_k)$ along $(k_n)$ with respect to some cutoff sequence $(M_n)$.
\begin{enumerate}
\item[(i)]  If
$(n\pi_n)$ is bounded, then
\begin{equation}

d_{\mathrm{TV}} \left( \# \{u \in \mathcal{T}^{n} : G_{k_{n}}( \mathcal{T}^{n}_{u})=1\},\mathrm{Poisson}(n \pi_{n})\right)  \quad \mathop{\longrightarrow}_{n \rightarrow \infty} \quad 0.
