{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:47:22.245482+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e3180858f0a346d003a01b9e84f4aff85700f70f0cc16e8b98332f2e67518ed2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 13 ({\cite[Theorem 4.3) of arXiv:2605.26664, 'Mixing times for Glauber dynamics of lozenge tilings of the hexagon'] {CMT}}]

