{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:32:58.358674+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e4a26f8fd31724bb56845d0ef581bbcc3a33327cc2e7aa8b0ff0d764a9b41513","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 14 of arXiv:2506.18834, '\large\bf On the random-time and finite-time ruin probability for widely dependent claim s'] Let $\xi_{i},i\geq1$ be WUOD random variables with a common distribution $V$ on $(-\infty,\infty)$
