{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:29:35.077392+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e5765349d0173bd13fa154f4df02a19e2e65f044f6885410e8c1b2022fb776b6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 3 of arXiv:2609.03793, 'Typical martingale diverges on a co-$\sigma$-porous set'] Let $\f,\g\in\M_\infty$ and $\nu\in 2^\N$. Let also $r>d>0$ be such that 
