{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:36:16.059814+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e93daff30a73063ce7c446aced4270b80ec759448226d24de64ba0c0bb7b0523","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:characteristic function V of arXiv:2606.28031, 'Insurance risk models in a heterogeneous time-dependent population: scaling limits and rui'] The characteristic function of $V$ is given, for $t\geqslant 0$ and $\alpha \in \mathbb{R}$, by
