{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:35:10.799374+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eaacbc6ad2ce81fd746bb6c2b18402fe15bcf0e070e825c84b68708e649a7f10","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 67 of arXiv:2604.00635, 'Large deviations of the periodic Toda chain'] Let $\bs{\eta}_N \in \R^N_{<}$, then one has
