{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:28:49.121879+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eab5340cc65748f985f707f7b0d44daa7c0ffa69b59d253634a17f668c4ba332","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:incidence-bound of arXiv:2608.18293, 'Critical tensor covariance at the Marchenko--Pastur threshold'] Assume $n>2d$. Let $b=(b_I)_{I\in\Omega_{n,d}}\in\mathbb{C}^{\Omega_{n,d}}$ satisfy
\[
  \sum_{I\in\Omega_{n,d}}b_I=0.
\]
Then for $1\le r\le d$,
