{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:01:22.580857+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ed14af5ce7a14dfe981e4ab41eb177004d4173e253ff9181aa2c57644b42e7be","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Lemma-Q2 n m of arXiv:2605.16963, 'Stochastic Euler Equations with Pseudo-differential Noise: Continuous and Discontinuous Pe'] Suppose that $0\le \theta<s-3\delta_2$, where $\delta_2=\delta_{\mathcal Q_2}$ is given in (equation delta-Qi of the paper).  Let (Hypo-W L of the paper) hold and let $\wp_n$ be the Marcus flow 
