{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:18:19.416382+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ee37607cc4c670ae1f05fdd17d6852471146e1f2e6e6b5a40e10fa1e604e1ecf","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:no_holes_in_waterfall_region of arXiv:2507.22011, 'Random Lozenge Waterfall:\\Dimensional Collapse of Gibbs Measures'] Let the parameters
