{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:41:29.045075+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eef01e500a50a6e57f9b373e9552dafccfa252156fb70201f43c06257365616e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 (Boundary reaction; cf.\ Proposition A.8 of \cite{Brendle2019}, Lemma 4.8 of \cite{Chen2024}) of arXiv:2608.26598, 'Pinching cones for positive isotropic curvature in dimensions seven and eight'] Let $n\ge5$, let $S\in\CB(\mathbb R^n)$, and let $H$ be a symmetric two-tensor. Suppose that
