{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:47:07.704575+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ef1441ac698dc5ecc15dd2f340d4a307b9a2bea9eb8a7de16c40dd2032cd8daa","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 13 of arXiv:2608.06038, 'Efron type identities\\ for stopping sets and Poisson hulls'] Suppose that $Z\colon \bN\to\cX$ is a Markov set. 
