{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:06:21.712961+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f16ba027c5f2f9e5d9d93fad02ba6c8ccb3f46fac394106afb63106437c2a23c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 ({\cite[Lemma~3.1 and Proposition~3.2) of arXiv:2607.21374, 'Local structure at the maximum and sharp persistence asymptotics of rough fractional Brown'] {moench2026horizonProblem}}]

