  \end{equation*}
  of \(\setF_p\)-stacks, where \(\pi_S \colon S \to S^{\dR}\) is the natural morphism given in \Cref{DefdeRhamStack} and \(\sigma_{S,r} \colon W_rS_{\setF_p} \to S^{\dR}\) is the morphism obtained by \cite{petrov2025Decomposition}*{Corollary~4.4} (\Cref{ConstPetrov}).","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:57:51.764310+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f1a33e392bc9ff56b7074315c8527c326cd20dd369942a4e12d9a2851c6a043d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 10 (Uniform half-line stability) of arXiv:2608.30211, '2608.30211'] The map $\varrho\mapsto\mu_\varrho$ is continuous on $[0,1]$ and
