{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:36:31.234198+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f4f6a56096a4e6003ab7c306abfa66b8a79044fd28f41394ec25b5b2526f53a7","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 13 of arXiv:2609.00567, 'Hodge--Tate splitting and Akizuki--Nakano vanishing in positive characteristic'] Consider a pullback square of fpqc algebraic stacks
  \begin{equation*}
    \begin{tikzcd}
