\mathbb{P}\!\left[\|Y\|_\infty^2 \ge C\,\frac{\log(n/\delta)}{n}\right]\le \delta.
\]","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:41:11.632428+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f68ed2c65bb6b45015450e9da02e577a7bf840ccff4ddb42640d0b25371ada2e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem th:d4 of arXiv:2411.13505, 'Capacity of loop-erased random walk'] Let $d=4$. Then almost surely,
