{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:25:06.197334+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f757eec578529b9ae5f09cf5d7774c85c40768bf712ef9ca7db80e1ee8f639e6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 10 (Finite-time convergence of the normalized latent recursion) of arXiv:2608.22636, 'Q-Learning with Stable Infinite-Dimensional \\Linear Function Approximation'] Suppose Assumptions~\ref{assump:mdp}, \ref{assump:mix},
