{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:35:10.780551+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f7a8249f5f6acf031c224e467f2f1f58cd4349d0f349c0e6a2684e1bbe6c9610","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 3 of arXiv:2603.29549, 'Multitype PCR branching processes'] Consider the density process $\bar  X(n)$ of the MPCR branching process. Under the assumptions of Theorem \ref{mainthm}, for any fixed integer $n\in \mathbb Z$, we have
