{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:52:57.735304+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f8f8db553ee38aa6b57ad548a5e35472c1941c3af54fb158c9eb1880d1dcaeb7","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 25 of arXiv:2609.02755, 'The Sharp Rate of Probabilistically Strong Convergence to the KPZ Equation'] For $\Delta^\partial : \langle \mcT \rangle \to \langle \mcT \rangle \otimes \langle \mcT_1 \rangle$, we can write
