  Consequently, for every \(R\in(0,\infty]\), every \(\sigma_0>0\), every \(0\leqslant s\leqslant
  r\) and every \(P\in\mathfrak P_s\) on \(\mathcal D_{R,A,\mathcal{K}_{\mathcal{S}},\sigma_0} \), one has
