{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:09:49.824915+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f9f61df9bd281d3627bfd40a7dc39be8b3ae2e1da1690faa1957b0f9870cf13e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 31 of arXiv:2609.03070, 'Variants of order semicontinuity in Banach lattices'] The following conditions are equivalent:
