{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:06:21.750544+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fe58c78dc1ce865fd9a2d471bf8bc2fa68a93fb4cdbbeead93ead956f5c54c7d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 42 of arXiv:2607.21374, 'Local structure at the maximum and sharp persistence asymptotics of rough fractional Brown'] For every \(0\leq R<\infty\),
